      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Business Growth Consulting for SMBs and Founder-Led Businesses</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-60d9728 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="60d9728"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <p class="p1">
          At VentureBean, we partner with <b
            >SMBs, family-owned businesses, founder-led companies, and growth-stage organisations</b
          > to build the systems, leadership capability, and business structures required for sustainable growth.
        </p><p class="p2">
